<section class="space-y-6">
  <header class="space-y-2">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Effective date: <%= effectiveDate %></p>
  </header>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Data collected</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700">
      <li>Account and login data such as email and session records.</li>
      <li>Settings and job search preferences: roles, locations, languages, and profile text.</li>
      <li>API keys when you use bring-your-own-key mode.</li>
      <li>CV uploads and CV comparison artifacts.</li>
      <li>Saved jobs, notes, verdict overrides, and applied status.</li>
      <li>Usage, run, and cost logs for billing and debugging.</li>
      <li>Payment/customer status metadata received from Paddle.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">How data is used</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700">
      <li>Run job searches and filtering workflows.</li>
      <li>Call AI and scraping providers for scoring and enrichment.</li>
      <li>Send digest and operational emails.</li>
      <li>Calculate and audit credit usage.</li>
      <li>Operate, improve, and debug the service.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Sensitive data notice</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">CVs, profile prompts, and job-preference text may include personal employment history. When you run scoring or CV comparison, this information is sent to configured AI providers for processing.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Third parties</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Processors and integrations can include Paddle, AI providers (such as OpenAI or Anthropic), Apify or scraping providers, Resend/email providers, and infrastructure or logging providers.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">API key storage</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">At this time, API keys configured in app settings are stored in the app database as plain text, not encrypted at rest by the application layer. Restrict infrastructure access and prefer self-hosting controls if this is a concern.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Payment data</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Card and payment details are handled by Paddle. The service receives limited billing/customer/payment status information needed for account and credit management.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Retention</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Account data is kept while your account exists. Usage and run logs may be retained for billing, security, and debugging. Data can be deleted on request unless retention is required for legal or payment records.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Your rights</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700">
      <li>Request access, export, correction, or deletion of your data.</li>
      <li>Revoke, rotate, or remove API keys.</li>
      <li>Delete uploaded CVs and related artifacts.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Security</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Reasonable practical safeguards are used, but no method of storage or transmission is completely secure.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">International transfers</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Third-party providers may process data in countries different from your own jurisdiction.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Privacy requests: <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>" class="text-blue-700 hover:underline"><%= supportEmail %></a>.</p>
  </section>
</section>
